    {
      "index": 2,
      "width": 595.280029296875,
      "height": 841.8900146484375,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0000",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Wang et al.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 35.44114879999995,
            "x1": 372.6741669257803,
            "y1": 42.11895800000002
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0001",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "the demand for tooth whitening worldwide. It has been recognized that the localized use of hydrogen peroxide (HP) for bleaching teeth has been in practice since the 1980s. Now the effectiveness of various whitening strips with HP as the active ingredient have been proven and they are widely used in clinical whitening (2).",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 75.05999999999995,
            "x1": 292.69608328,
            "y1": 131.74299999999994
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0002",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "HP  is  a  highly  permeable  small  molecule  that  can  easily penetrate  the  enamel  surface  to  the  deeper  layers  of  the  tooth, breaking down large pigment molecules into smaller ones. These smaller  molecules  spread  to  the  surface  of  the  tooth  and  are absorbed, resulting in a whitening effect  (3). High-concentration HP (25%-40%) tooth bleaching products  are commonly used  in in-office  bleaching  (4),  and  physical  barriers  are  required  for hard  tissue prophylaxis  and  soft tissue  protection.  However, high-concentration HP has been reported to have multiple risks. The  sensitivity  of  teeth  during  and  after  bleaching  is  related  to microscopic  surface  defects  and  enamel  pores  that  allow  the bleaching  agents  to  enter  the  pulp  quickly.  High-concentration HP can also induce inflammatory responses and lead to necrosis of  the  pulp  tissue  due  to  its  irritating  and  cytotoxic  potential (5).  Gingival irritation and corrosion of mucous membranes and skin have also been reported (6).",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.605999999999995,
            "y0": 135.04099999999994,
            "x1": 292.68004519999994,
            "y1": 323.76199999999994
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0003",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "At-home  bleaching  requires  bleaching  products  with  lower concentrations,  one  of  which  is  tray  bleaching  containing  10%20% carbamide peroxide (CP) (7, 8). Another option is whitening  strips,  which  can  avoid  the  step  of  customizing  the tray  compared  to  tray  bleaching,  thus  being  more  convenient. Whitening  strips  at-home  bleaching  typically  contain  5%-15% HP, this kind of low-concentration HP is considered gentler and is  also  effective  for  removing  extrinsic  tooth  discoloration  (9), but still  presents  a  light  cytotoxicity  (10-13).  Therefore, in  order to  pursue  a  more  safe  and  comfortable  whitening  effect,  Lowconcentration Whitestrips used in this study only contain 3% HP.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.605999999999995,
            "y0": 327.05999999999995,
            "x1": 292.6624912,
            "y1": 455.7432
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0004",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "For a comprehensive assessment of tooth color change when performing  bleaching  with  Low-concentration  Whitestrips,  the Vita Easyshade digital shade guide was used to assess the primary  outcomes,  providing  an  objective  evaluation  of  tooth color,  while  the  secondary  outcomes  were  determined  using  the VITA  3D-Master  shade  guide  for  a  subjective  evaluation.  Both methods  were used to evaluate the same clinical outcome, namely  tooth  color  change,  allowing  complementary  assessment from  instrumental  and  visual  perspectives.  At  the  same  time, adverse  events  (AEs)  and  serious  adverse  events  (SAEs)  were recorded during the process.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 459.041,
            "x1": 292.5907677999999,
            "y1": 587.7815
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0005",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Therefore,  a  prospective,  single-center,  parallel,  controlled, randomized, double-blind clinical trial was conducted to evaluate  the  effectiveness  and  safety  of  the  Low-concentration Whitestrips.  We  tested  the  following  three  null  hypotheses:  that bleaching with low-concentration Whitestrips (1) does not result in  significant  tooth  color  change,  and  (2)  does  not  influence  the incidence of AEs/SAEs.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 591.0219999999999,
            "x1": 292.6673956,
            "y1": 671.7429999999999
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0006",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "Materials and methods",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 696.463,
            "x1": 193.5499258,
            "y1": 709.342
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0007",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "Ethical aspects",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 720.5970744,
            "x1": 132.91199858006001,
            "y1": 732.044979
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0008",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "All procedures were performed in compliance with relevant laws and  institutional  guidelines  and  have  been  approved  by  the appropriate institutional committees. This study was approved by the  Ethics  Committee  of  West  China  Hospital  of  Stomatology Sichuan  University  for  the  protection  of  human  participants (WCHSIRB-D-2023-199). It was also registered in National Health  Information  Platform  (MR-51-23-033324)  and  Chinese Clinical  Trial  Registry  (ChiCTR2300073971).  And  the  privacy rights  of  human  subjects  have  been  observed  and  that  informed consent  was  obtained  for  experimentation  with  human  subjects. We used the CONSORT checklist when writing our report (14).",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 49.6063,
            "y0": 747.0975999999999,
            "x1": 292.69917030000005,
            "y1": 779.7995
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0009",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "Sample size",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 304.724,
            "y0": 192.5590744,
            "x1": 370.85220892700005,
            "y1": 204.006979
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0010",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "This  is  an  exploratory  study,  and  therefore,  a  sample  size calculation based on statistical power was not feasible due to the absence  of  prior  data.  Instead,  the  sample  size  was  justified based  on  similar  clinical  studies  and  the  guidelines  from  the China Oral Care Industry Association (T/COCIA 8-2020). A  target  of  60  evaluable  subjects  was  set.  To  compensate  for  an anticipated  dropout  rate  of  15%,  approximately  70  participants will be enrolled in the study.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 304.725,
            "y0": 219.05999999999995,
            "x1": 547.7905470000001,
            "y1": 311.7994
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0011",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "Recruitment",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 304.724,
            "y0": 336.5590744,
            "x1": 373.60732476750997,
            "y1": 348.00697899999994
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0012",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Evaluations  were  conducted  during  the  clinical  process.  The eligibility criteria are as follows:",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 304.725,
            "y0": 363.11699999999996,
            "x1": 547.7230810000001,
            "y1": 383.7997
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0013",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Inclusion Criteria",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 387.09799999999996,
            "x1": 386.025175,
            "y1": 395.81899999999996
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0014",
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "Age between 18 and 55 years, with no gender restrictions;",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 411.07899999999995,
            "x1": 545.4129829000002,
            "y1": 419.79999999999995
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0015",
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "In good general health, without serious systemic diseases;",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 423.09799999999996,
            "x1": 542.7764202999999,
            "y1": 431.81899999999996
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0016",
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "Eight incisors should be naturally well-aligned and without restorations or prosthetic crowns;",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 435.11699999999996,
            "x1": 547.7209257999999,
            "y1": 455.7997
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0017",
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "Have  extrinsic  tooth  discoloration  with  maxillary  incisors Vita shade guide value >1M1.5 evaluated by professionally trained dentists;",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 459.09799999999996,
            "x1": 547.7378629,
            "y1": 491.80019999999996
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0018",
          "kind": "list_item",
          "text": "Willingly participate in the trial, comply with clinical trial requirements, and follow up on time.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 318.898,
            "y0": 495.09799999999996,
            "x1": 547.6955431000001,
            "y1": 515.8385
          },
          "page": 2,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-ffae5e192586c330/b02_0019",
          "kind": "heading",
          "text": "Exclusion Criteria",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 304.725,
            "y0": 531.098,
            "x1": 373.213119,
